lls with me — which people share Bourton house share with me?\", \"Right, of those, could you narrow it down to just the Zdenka ones? That's who I actually need to look at.\"], [\"who's in Bourton house share?\", \"just Zdenka\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0009\", \"v\": [[\"star the common paperwork pls\", \"no wrong doc, i meant the granary one\", \"diff thing, what do i still need to get done sunday\"], [\"Could you please put a star on the common paperwork?\", \"Sorry, that's the wrong document — I meant the granary one.\", \"On another note, could you tell me what I still have to get done on sunday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0010\", \"v\": [[\"who owes me money rn\", \"just the ones over twelve pounds pls\"], [\"I'm doing a bit of a money catch-up this weekend and I've honestly lost track, so who owes me money at the moment?\", \"Right, and out of those, could you just show me the ones over twelve pounds? Not worth chasing the small stuff.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0011\", \"v\": [[\"delete the sunflower note pls\", \"oh and which group did the car hire go in\", \"put the archway photo in the Bovmawen 2027 album thx\"], [\"Could you please delete the sunflower note?\", \"Also, could you tell me which group the car hire went into?\", \"Would you mind adding the archway photo to the Bovmawen 2027 album, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0012\", \"v\": [[\"Could you delete the xylophone note, please?\", \"Also, would you count how many pictures I have from Bovmawen?\", \"Could you show me photos of Idris Bysbiez, please?\", \"One more thing — could you tell me what the Bourton total is so far?\"], [\"I'm tidying up my notes and that one's just clutter now, so could you get rid of the xylophone note?\", \"Different thing — I was telling someone about the trip and couldn't remember, how many pictures have I got from Bovmawen?\", \"Oh, and I'm hunting for a nice one to send along, so can you pull up photos of Idris Bysbiez?\", \"Separate question, I'm trying to see where we stand before settling up — what's the Bourton total so far?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0013\", \"v\": [[\"whats left on my todo list\", \"can the copperplate party thing go to thursday instead\", \"no wrong one, i meant the shutter viewing\"], [\"umm what's… what have I still got left on my to-do list?\", \"oh and, uh, can the copperplate party appointment move to thursday instead?\", \"no wait, sorry, not that one — I meant the shutter viewing one\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0014\", \"v\": [[\"Could you show me what's in the Kids notebook, please?\", \"Would you delete the first one, please?\", \"Actually, sorry — could you put it back, please?\"], [\"whats in the Kids notebook\", \"delete the first one\", \"wait scratch that, put it back\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0015\", \"v\": [[\"umm so who is actually coming to the, uh, the netball viewing?\"], [\"Could you tell me who is coming to the netball viewing, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0016\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to sort my plans around it and I just can't remember — when is the netball viewing?\", \"Oh, and while I think of it, that canex rail paperwork matters, so could you put a star on it for me?\"], [\"netball viewing when?\", \"star canex rail paperwork\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0017\", \"v\": [[\"Could you show me my pictures from Bacalar Bakery, please?\", \"Could you tell me where the granary one was taken, please?\", \"Sorry, quick question before I forget — who still has to pay me back?\", \"Thank you. Going back to the bakery pictures, could you show me the photos from there, please?\"], [\"I was going to recommend the place to a friend and wanted to show them, so could you pull up my pictures from Bacalar Bakery?\", \"That granary one looks lovely but I can't quite place it — where was it actually taken?\", \"Hang on, random thought while I've got my phone out — who still has to pay me back? I keep forgetting to chase it.\", \"Ok, back to what we were doing with the bakery pictures — can you just show me the photos from there?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0018\", \"v\": [[\"diary entries last week\", \"expenses over one hundred and ninety pounds?\"], [\"Could you show me my diary entries from last week, please?\", \"Also, could you tell me which expenses were over one hundred and ninety pounds?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0020\", \"v\": [[\"bin the pantry file pls\", \"oops undo that\"], [\"trash pantry file\", \"undo\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0021\", \"v\": [[\"where's the gramophone close-up?\", \"which album?\", \"show photos in it\", \"hang on, any Kazuo notes?\", \"back to the album — delete the Zdenka one\"], [\"umm where did the gramophone close-up go?\", \"oh ok, and which album is it in?\", \"can you, uh, show me the photos in that album?\", \"hang on, sorry — have I got anything on Kazuo, like, notes?\", \"ok right, back to the gramophone thing — umm, delete the Zdenka one\"]]}","ttft_ms":26927,"type":"result","duration_ms":40067,"uuid":"8ba733f5-5bb1-4375-8c06-6ee1b69e09b6","ttft_stream_ms":1361,"time_to_request_ms":132,"first_content_frame_ms":1361,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22192192,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278742600.9905,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
